{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43084","headline":"吴宫怨 · 卫万","name":"吴宫怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见吴王宫阁临江起，不见珠帘见江水。\n晓气晴来双阙间，潮声夜落千门里。\n句践城中非旧春，姑苏台下起黄尘。\n祗今唯有西江月，曾照吴王宫里人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卫万","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}